From a627f67e5189768c616cffc3f64894ace064bbde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grok Bot <grokbot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:53:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/21] perf(store): cache prepared SQLite statements per
 connection

DurableTaskStore re-compiled every SQL statement on each call (60 call
sites, including hot paths such as getTask/appendEvent/wait polling).
Statements are now prepared once and reused; all SQL text is static so
the cache is bounded. The cache is cleared on close().
