Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

resolveQuotaSnapshot() copied the entire raw quota object into
rawSnapshot, which is returned through ui_probe_quota / overview to the
VS Code webview. Any token/secret/authorization-like key present in a
probe or imported quota payload therefore crossed the daemon → UI
boundary. This is what made the existing integration test
(socket.test.ts, WIRE_SECRET_CANARY) fail on main. Run the payload
through the same redact() used for runtime events; adds a unit test.
