From 5c31545c724b789ac3a9fe1aacf2702c1f25b43e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grok Bot <grokbot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:13:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/21] feat(vscode/icons): crisp activity-bar mark,
 marketplace icon and codicons for commands

- media/zcode-pool.svg: new 24x24 monochrome currentColor mark (rounded
  frame + Z) on the 1.5px codicon grid instead of a hard-coded #c5c5c5
  server glyph
- media/icon.png (128x128, rendered from media/icon-source.svg) as the
  extension icon; allowlisted in .vscodeignore and package:check
- every contributed command now has a codicon, and views declare an icon
  for when they are moved out of the activity-bar container
- task tree items use a status-specific codicon with a theme color
  (spinning loading for running, pass/error with testing colors, ...)
- README credits Codicons (CC BY 4.0)
