 visible + announced feedback
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 收工 (pool.shutdown), task cancel and worker stop now arm an inline
  two-step confirmation (prompt + danger confirm + cancel). Focus lands on the
  confirm button; Escape, cancel or any other action disarms. No request is
  sent until confirmed. Public commands and Host behaviour are unchanged.
- Successful local actions (save, copy diagnostics, import...) previously only
  wrote to an off-screen region; they now show a dismissible success flash.
- Screen-reader announcements move to persistent polite/assertive live regions
  outside the re-rendered root (the old in-tree region was recreated on every
  render and announced unreliably). Receipt phase changes are announced once.
- Failed receipts use role=alert; others role=status.
- Tests: unit coverage for confirm/Escape/cancel, flash, live regions and
  receipt roles; browser test confirms cancel needs two clicks and moves focus,
  and saves a confirm.png screenshot.
